    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/0e62333508135e0cca4fb66c8b2f67be.avif?t=1746707504\" width=640 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Synopsis</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officer Gabriel, Sgt. Natalia &amp; Col. John Tyson are investigating an abandoned town. Many residents claim it is a cursed place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they investigate, they encounter inexplicable phenomena and struggle to survive in critical conditions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Mode</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in various mode starting from Investigation, Rescue, or Versus. No matter what you choose, zombie will chasing you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/2aedb07bb5af7aa627bd2f0b512e17c9.poster.avif?t=1746707504\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/2aedb07bb5af7aa627bd2f0b512e17c9.webm?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/2aedb07bb5af7aa627bd2f0b512e17c9.mp4?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Co-Op Split Screen</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your closest person or family, become a solid partner or challenge them to prove who's the badass investigator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/4a72f35ac867e1e02f533ca2012a875d.poster.avif?t=1746707504\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/4a72f35ac867e1e02f533ca2012a875d.webm?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/4a72f35ac867e1e02f533ca2012a875d.mp4?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate the Anomaly</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifed accident came to the Outer Town. Get your clues, find the way out, and survive from the living corpse in this cursed land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/a65f79930fc574f4c3f3bdcfabc4c681.poster.avif?t=1746707504\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/a65f79930fc574f4c3f3bdcfabc4c681.webm?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/a65f79930fc574f4c3f3bdcfabc4c681.mp4?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the Professor</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a professor doing a research in the cursed land, however something bad happened, something not expected. Protect him and stay alive until rescue arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/e6e7a2eff772f78c6cffd3214faf8ca6.poster.avif?t=1746707504\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/e6e7a2eff772f78c6cffd3214faf8ca6.webm?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/e6e7a2eff772f78c6cffd3214faf8ca6.mp4?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete your Partner</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your partner to prove who's the best investigator. Remember, no matter where you are, it's always zombie chasing for scar.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/ff5a76f256e59db1573157ce819cbcf8.poster.avif?t=1746707504\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/ff5a76f256e59db1573157ce819cbcf8.webm?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/ff5a76f256e59db1573157ce819cbcf8.mp4?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PromiZed Land: Outer Town 2025</strong> is a third-person shooter horror simulator that takes you into a cursed land. Experience an immersive shooting game that blends excitement and thrill with moments of joy and satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>#EnterTheCursedLand\u00a0#LostInOuterTown\u00a0</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/0e62333508135e0cca4fb66c8b2f67be.avif?t=1746707504\" width=640 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Synopsis</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officer Gabriel, Sgt. Natalia &amp; Col. John Tyson are investigating an abandoned town. Many residents claim it is a cursed place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they investigate, they encounter inexplicable phenomena and struggle to survive in critical conditions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Mode</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in various mode starting from Investigation, Rescue, or Versus. No matter what you choose, zombie will chasing you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/2aedb07bb5af7aa627bd2f0b512e17c9.poster.avif?t=1746707504\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/2aedb07bb5af7aa627bd2f0b512e17c9.webm?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355610/extras/2aedb07bb5af7aa627bd2f0b512e17c9.mp4?t=1746707504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Co-Op Split Screen</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your closest person or family, become a solid partner or challenge them to prove who's the badass investigator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct